msgid "Config"
msgstr "설정"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:208
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:225
msgid "app/Config/Feature.php"
msgstr "app/Config/Feature.php"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:209
msgid "``Config\\Feature::$autoRoutesImproved`` has been changed to ``true``."
msgstr "``Config\\Feature::$autoRoutesImproved``\ 가 ``true``\ 로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:210
msgid "``Config\\Feature::$strictLocaleNegotiation`` has been added."
msgstr "``Config\\Feature::$strictLocaleNegotiation``\ 이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:211
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:228
msgid "app/Config/Routing.php"
msgstr "app/Config/Routing.php"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:212
msgid ""
"``Config\\Routing::$translateUriToCamelCase`` has been changed to "
"``true``."
msgstr "``Config\\Routing::$translateUriToCamelCase``\ 가 ``true``\ 로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:213
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:227
msgid "app/Config/Kint.php"
msgstr "app/Config/Kint.php"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:214
msgid ""
"``Config\\Kint::$richSort`` has been removed. Kint in v6 no longer uses "
"``AbstractRenderer::SORT_FULL``. Leaving this property in your code will "
"cause a runtime error due to the undefined constant."
msgstr ""
"``Config\\Kint::$richSort``\ 가 제거되었습니다. v6의 Kint는 더 이상 "
"``AbstractRenderer::SORT_FULL``\ 을 사용하지 않습니다. 이 속성을 코드에 남겨두면 "
"정의되지 않은 상수로 인해 런타임 오류가 발생합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:217
msgid "All Changes"
msgstr "모든 변경 사항"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_460.rst:219
msgid ""
"This is a list of all files in the **project space** that received "
"changes; many will be simple comments or formatting that have no effect "
"on the runtime:"
msgstr ""
"다음은 **프로젝트 공간**에서 변경된 모든 파일의 목록입니다. "
"많은 파일이 런타임에 영향을 미치지 않는 단순한 주석이나 형식 변경일 수 있습니다:"

